    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95144" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκόροδον</span></b> , τό, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκόρδον</span></b>  (q.v.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>garlic, Allium sativum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.125
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.126
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				725.5
			</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">vi B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκορόδων κεφαλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					718
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				679
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκορόδοις ἀλείφειν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοροδίζειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pax</u>
				502
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα μή ποτε σκόροδα φάγῃ μηδὲ
				κυάμους μέλανας</span> if he doesn't want to eat
				<i>war-rations</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				690
			</span></i> (on <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυάμους</span> in this phrase
			cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>App.Prov.</u>
				3.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκόρδον</span>.
			</div>
